-- What the yearly clothing-allowance circulars and the yearly circulars on
-- recuperation pay and the jubilee grant print in the same words (MMS-775):
-- each such declaration is declared here once and imported by every circular
-- that prints it. A circular cites the rows a declaration encodes in a note
-- where the declaration stood; above each one here is where it is printed.
-- Kept apart from clothing-recuperation-circulars-common: in one module with it, a circular
-- that imports it would reach a name it declares otherwise.
-- `positions in quarters` is printed by the Finance Ministry's one-time grant
-- circular of 22.2.2016 too, which imports it from here.

IMPORT prelude

-- circular תשס"ז/6, circular תשס"ח/5, circular תשס"ט/9, circular תש"ע/3 and the Finance Ministry circular of 22.2.2016
`positions in quarters` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 4) (range 0 6)

-- circular תשס"ח/6, circular תשס"ט/10, circular תש"ע/5, circular תשע"א/3, circular תשע"ב/13 and circular תשע"ג/8
`the months sections ב and ג name for payment` MEANS EMPTY

-- circular תשס"ח/6, circular תשס"ט/10, circular תש"ע/5, circular תשע"א/3, circular תשע"ב/13 and circular תשע"ג/8
`sections ב and ג name no month of payment` MEANS
    `the months sections ב and ג name for payment` EQUALS EMPTY

-- circular תשע"א/3, circular תש"ף/11, circular תשפ"ב/7, circular תשפ"ג/9, circular תשפ"ד/11, circular תשפ"ה/12 and circular תשפ"ו/8
`the employer shares the multi-employer rule gives for 80% and 60%` MEANS LIST 0.8, 0.6

-- circular תשע"א/3, circular תש"ף/11, circular תשפ"ב/7, circular תשפ"ג/9, circular תשפ"ד/11, circular תשפ"ה/12 and circular תשפ"ו/8
`the one-position cap and the multi-employer rule disagree for two employers` MEANS
    sum `the employer shares the multi-employer rule gives for 80% and 60%` GREATER THAN 1

-- circular תשע"ד/7, circular תשע"ה/4, circular תשע"ו/7, circular תשע"ז/5, circular תשע"ח/4, circular תשע"ט/6, circular תש"ף/9, circular תשפ"א/7, circular תשפ"ג/8, circular תשפ"ה/11 and circular תשפ"ו/7
`the principal's limit in the limits clause` MEANS 1.5

-- circular תשע"ד/7, circular תשע"ה/4, circular תשע"ו/7, circular תשע"ז/5, circular תשע"ח/4, circular תשע"ט/6, circular תש"ף/9, circular תשפ"א/7, circular תשפ"ג/8, circular תשפ"ה/11 and circular תשפ"ו/7
`the limit the restatement gives one outside the reforms` MEANS 1.4

-- circular תשע"ד/7, circular תשע"ה/4, circular תשע"ו/7, circular תשע"ז/5, circular תשע"ח/4, circular תשע"ט/6, circular תש"ף/9, circular תשפ"א/7, circular תשפ"ג/8, circular תשפ"ה/11 and circular תשפ"ו/7
`the limits clause and its restatement give a principal outside the reforms different limits` MEANS
    NOT (`the principal's limit in the limits clause` EQUALS `the limit the restatement gives one outside the reforms`)

-- circular תשע"ח/4, circular תשע"ט/6, circular תש"ף/9, circular תשפ"ב/6, circular תשפ"ג/8 and circular תשפ"ו/7
`the jubilee shares §1ו gives for 80% and 60%` MEANS LIST 0.8, 0.6

-- circular תשע"ח/4, circular תשע"ט/6, circular תש"ף/9, circular תשפ"ב/6, circular תשפ"ג/8 and circular תשפ"ו/7
`the jubilee's one-position cap and §2ה(5) disagree for two employers` MEANS
    sum `the jubilee shares §1ו gives for 80% and 60%` GREATER THAN 1

-- circular תשפ"ג/8 and circular תשפ"ד/10
`the jubilee grant rate` MEANS 0.6
